flashes.description:
Current settings, by period:
{timeline}

A change applies from the date and time you choose, so energy already recorded keeps the value it was counted under. Use this for a new meter or a move. By default it lasts until the next recorded change, so correcting one period does not erase the others. Changes can go back as far as {oldest}.
